  <activityDataset>
    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="a165f45b-d915-5273-9560-e801026f3ebe" activityNameId="82c37c69-cf24-5240-8641-88977874f0dd" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Wrecking, transocean container ship</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Wrecking, transocean container ship
The emissions are determined based on the painted surface of a transoceanic vessel (10m2/LDT) and assumed LDT for transoceanic freight ship of  46000 LDT;
UUID: ddf3ddf0-a910-3a27-b506-4ff0e293b1c4
This process includes all the energy required for the wrecking of a transoceanic vessel in India. Also included are all the waste and emissions which are caused due to the wrecking.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Average technology
Time period: Time of publications
Production volume: na
Sampling: Statistics 
Extrapolations: Some generic datasets from ecoinvent have been used.
Uncertainty adjustments: None
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_ddf3ddf0-a910-3a27-b506-4ff0e293b1c4.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
